{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40525,"sections":[{"id":"script-20525","name":"原始脚本 20525","scripts":[20525],"start":0,"count":51}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:1","scriptId":20525,"text":"“把设备都堆到这里就行了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:2","scriptId":20525,"text":"由于波西娅临时冒出来的委托——收集多余的设备器材，所以我们小队加班加点去各大战场找回了不少废弃设备。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:3","scriptId":20525,"text":"但波西娅的实验室已经放不下那么多设备，于是只能把这些设备器材放到基地外的临时堆放点“晒太阳”。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:4","scriptId":20525,"text":"“波西娅说收集这点差不多就可以了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:5","scriptId":20525,"text":"“哦？是吗？佐伊她们还在搬呢，你去让她们停一下？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:6","scriptId":20525,"text":"“这些多余的设备留着干什么？卖废铁吗？让佐伊她们一起抬过来好了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:7","scriptId":20525,"text":"“呃……也行吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:8","scriptId":20525,"text":"奈特莉说得倒也在理，这些低级设备对我们队伍来说用处不大，留着也只不过是些废铁。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:9","scriptId":20525,"text":"“但……这些东西真的要给埃普西隆全部吃掉吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:10","scriptId":20525,"text":"虽然波西娅的任务没有明说，但我们都很清楚这是给埃普西隆准备的“饵食”。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:11","scriptId":20525,"text":"因为一部分小型设备送去的时候就直接被埃普西隆给吞了……而且吃的时候还会挑挑拣拣、评头论足。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:12","scriptId":20525,"text":"（以埃普西隆目前的体型，吃完这些设备少说也要三四个月的样子……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:13","scriptId":20525,"text":"正当我在为埃普西隆的食量担心的时候——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:14","scriptId":20525,"text":"“哟～我的奴仆们～你们的进度如何了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:15","scriptId":20525,"text":"突然感到肩膀一沉——原来是埃普西隆，不知她是用了什么手段跑到我左肩上的。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:16","scriptId":20525,"text":"“如你所见，差不多告一段落了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:17","scriptId":20525,"text":"“不错嘛～手脚挺麻利的～我等会儿就去尝尝～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:18","scriptId":20525,"text":"“既然是任务当然要上点心了，话说你这么大大咧咧地跑出来不要紧吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:19","scriptId":20525,"text":"“只要不出基地的范围就没关系。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:20","scriptId":20525,"text":"突然天上划过一道金光，吸引了我的目光。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:21","scriptId":20525,"text":"“嗯？那是什么东西？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":855,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:22","scriptId":20525,"text":"“那好像是战车兽。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":855,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:23","scriptId":20525,"text":"埃普西隆的视力远比我要来得好，既然她这么说那应该没错了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":855,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:24","scriptId":20525,"text":"“为什么会有那种东西？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":855,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":854,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:25","scriptId":20525,"text":"“可能是你们晒了太多设备在外面，把它吸引过来了？不过金色的战车兽很少见啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:26","scriptId":20525,"text":"“要趁警报响起之前干掉它，不然到时候一团乱，我们辛苦收集的装备可就要遭殃了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:27","scriptId":20525,"text":"就在我准备召集佐伊她们进行拦截攻击的时候——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":854,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:28","scriptId":20525,"text":"“慢着，这只战车兽并不是来搞破坏的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:29","scriptId":20525,"text":"穿着斗篷的兰布达和波西娅出现了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:30","scriptId":20525,"text":"“哦吼？这就是你刚才在研究室里跟我说的报酬？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:31","scriptId":20525,"text":"“恩，是鞘翅目的犀金龟科甲虫，我以前的研究战车兽样本之一。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:32","scriptId":20525,"text":"“哦，独角仙啊。不过这东西本来很小才对，你是怎么把它改造成那种大小的？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:33","scriptId":20525,"text":"“商业机密。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:34","scriptId":20525,"text":"兰布达对那东西挥了挥手，很快那只金色独角仙就停到了我们堆放的设备上。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1103,"speaker":"追猎独角仙G","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:35","scriptId":20525,"text":"“.../-/.-/-./-../-....-/-.../-.--/”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":1103,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:36","scriptId":20525,"text":"能听见昆虫甲壳相互碰撞所发出的敲击声，也许是材质的关系这敲击音听起来更像是电码……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":1103,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:37","scriptId":20525,"text":"“那这个战车兽就当是给你的报酬了，因为这次的酬劳是由兰布达支付，但她好像没什么值钱的东西。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:38","scriptId":20525,"text":"“什么！？呃……您太能说笑了……这东西怎么能当报酬……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:39","scriptId":20525,"text":"“这战车兽的机甲是用黄金制作的，人类对这种矿物应该会很喜欢才对……难道情报有误？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:40","scriptId":20525,"text":"“什么！？黄……黄金！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:41","scriptId":20525,"text":"一开始以为只是黄色的涂装，但是走近了看才认识到这华贵的光芒——是货真价实的黄金……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:42","scriptId":20525,"text":"“那……我就收下了～？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:43","scriptId":20525,"text":"兰布达走到我的跟前，伸手在我的胸前比划了一会儿，然后在我手上出现了一个闪光的纹章。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:44","scriptId":20525,"text":"纹章闪亮了一会儿就消失得无影无踪。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:45","scriptId":20525,"text":"“指挥权永久更换，接下来就是你的事情了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:46","scriptId":20525,"text":"“作为战斗单位这东西能发挥一定的效果，或者你把它身上的黄金部分卸下来当通货处理也可以。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:47","scriptId":20525,"text":"“不过那样的话，这战车兽可能就没用了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:48","scriptId":20525,"text":"“呃……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:49","scriptId":20525,"text":"（黄金装甲真是不错，很值钱又华丽高档……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:50","scriptId":20525,"text":"（不过具有实战价值的战车兽也是不可多得战力，只是要向维多利亚团长申请个大仓库来养这东西……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20525:20525:51","scriptId":20525,"text":"“你们真是给我出了道难题啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
